{title: 033 - Sing a New Song to the Lord}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: Worship}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
[G]Sing a new [F]song to the [G]Lor[F]d, [G]He to whom [Dm]wonders be[G]lon[F]g.
[F]Re[Em]joice in His [A]triumph and [Em]tell of His [F]pow[D7]er.
[D7]O[G]sin[Dm7]g a new [Am7]song[D7]  to the [G]Lo[Am7]rd.[G][Am7][G]

Verse 2:
[G][F]Now [G]to [F]the [G]ends [Dm]of [G]the [F]earth
[F][Em]See [A]His [Em]salvation [F]is [D7]shown.
[D7][G]And [Dm7]still [Am7]He [D7]remembers [G][Am7]His [G]mercy [Am7]and [G]truth,
[G][F]Unchanging [G]in [F]love [G][Dm]to [G]His [F]own.

Verse 3:
[G][F]Sing [G]a [F]new [G][Dm]song [G]and [F]rejoice.
[F][Em]Publish [A]His [Em][F]praises [D7]abroad.
[D7][G]Let [Dm7]voices [Am7]in [D7]chorus [G][Am7]with [G]trumpet [Am7]and [G]horn,
[G][F]Resound [G]for [F]the [G]joy [Dm]of [G]the [F]Lord.

Verse 4:
[G][F]Join [G]with [F]the [G]hills [Dm]and [G]the [F]sea,
[F][Em]Thunders [A]of [Em]praise [F]to [D7]prolong.
[D7][G][Dm7]In [Am7][D7]judgment [G][Am7][G]and [Am7][G]justice
[G][F]He [G][F]comes [G]to [Dm][G]the [F]earth.
[F]O [Em]sing [A]a new [Em]song [F]to [D7]the Lord.
